 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "data is a list of integer lists (inner lists may be empty) read as one continuous stream: the first inner list left to right, then the second, and so on. size is a positive integer. Cut the stream into consecutive chunks of exactly size values; the last chunk holds the remaining values when fewer than size are left. Return the chunks in order; an empty stream gives an empty list.",
